WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.033 --> 00:00:04.033
♪♪

00:00:04.033 --> 00:00:05.667
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:09.501
Last night was Super Bowl LVII,
and out of habit,

00:00:09.501 --> 00:00:11.934
Biden shot down
the Goodyear blimp.

00:00:15.934 --> 00:00:17.767
The so called
"He gets us" campaign

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:19.934
ran two commercials
during the Super Bowl last night

00:00:19.934 --> 00:00:21.667
to promote Jesus
and Christianity.

00:00:21.667 --> 00:00:23.601
However, thanks to the referees,

00:00:23.601 --> 00:00:26.367
Philadelphia no longer
believes in God.

00:00:28.901 --> 00:00:31.400
During her halftime show
performance at last night's

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:33.567
Super Bowl, Rihanna revealed
that she was pregnant

00:00:33.567 --> 00:00:38.434
while the rest of us
just ate like we were.

00:00:38.434 --> 00:00:41.734
According to new analysis,
more than 50 million Americans

00:00:41.734 --> 00:00:44.567
were expected to gamble
this year on the Super Bowl --

00:00:44.567 --> 00:00:48.133
by serving Buffalo wings
and a one-bathroom apartment.

00:00:52.601 --> 00:00:55.467
Elon Musk was photographed
last night at the Super Bowl

00:00:55.467 --> 00:00:57.501
sitting next to Fox Chairman
Rupert Murdoch.

00:00:57.501 --> 00:00:59.300
I think we have a photo.

00:01:02.801 --> 00:01:05.801
There you go.

00:01:05.801 --> 00:01:07.267
The State Department today

00:01:07.267 --> 00:01:09.767
issued a do not travel advisory
for Russia.

00:01:09.767 --> 00:01:13.100
Yeah, we weren't planning on it.

00:01:13.100 --> 00:01:14.734
Bad news, kids.

00:01:14.734 --> 00:01:16.934
I know you had your heart set
on going to the Kremlin,

00:01:16.934 --> 00:01:21.801
but looks like
we're going to do Disney.

00:01:21.801 --> 00:01:23.200
The State Department
said last week

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:25.200
that the downed
Chinese spy balloon

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:26.534
was carrying
surveillance equipment

00:01:26.534 --> 00:01:29.000
capable of intercepting
communications.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:31.267
They needed some way
on spying on people

00:01:31.267 --> 00:01:33.534
who still haven't
downloaded TikTok.

00:01:35.834 --> 00:01:37.534
The FBI announced on Friday

00:01:37.534 --> 00:01:39.934
that it found an additional
classified document

00:01:39.934 --> 00:01:42.634
at former vice president
Mike Pence's Indiana home.

00:01:42.634 --> 00:01:46.133
Even weirder, they found it
in a file marked "Work stuff."

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:51.801
Oh, it actually -- it actually
is work stuff.

00:01:51.801 --> 00:01:55.901
An owl was recently removed from
a college library in Georgia.

00:01:55.901 --> 00:01:59.000
And this is annoying:
now it's saying "whom."

00:02:05.868 --> 00:02:10.601
My two favorite things,
Shoemaker: owls and grammar.

00:02:10.601 --> 00:02:12.634
Authorities in Texas
recently responded

00:02:12.634 --> 00:02:16.334
to a report of two goats
on the loose in a Target store.

00:02:16.334 --> 00:02:19.934
The goats were captured
and safely returned to TJ Maxx.

00:02:22.234 --> 00:02:23.634
And finally, a woman in Chile

00:02:23.634 --> 00:02:25.133
recently set
a Guinness World Record

00:02:25.133 --> 00:02:27.901
after swimming about one and a
half miles in Antarctic waters;

00:02:27.901 --> 00:02:31.300
said the woman,
"Can someone please rescue me?"

00:02:35.834 --> 00:02:38.234
And once again,
we've miscalculated

00:02:38.234 --> 00:02:41.467
what our closer was.

00:02:41.467 --> 00:02:43.634
Today is Valentine's Day.

00:02:43.634 --> 00:02:47.100
So if you're watching right now,
better luck next year.

00:02:49.767 --> 00:02:52.734
According to the latest numbers,
the average American is expected

00:02:52.734 --> 00:02:55.601
to spend $200 this year
on Valentine's Day --

00:02:55.601 --> 00:03:00.234
or $400 of you made
her breakfast in bed.

00:03:00.234 --> 00:03:03.434
Eggs are super expensive
right now, guys.

00:03:03.434 --> 00:03:07.834
That's a joke about egg-flation.

00:03:07.834 --> 00:03:10.667
That's what Bez' calls it.

00:03:10.667 --> 00:03:12.901
In a video today announcing
she's running for president,

00:03:12.901 --> 00:03:15.467
former U.N. ambassador
Nikki Haley said, quote,

00:03:15.467 --> 00:03:17.834
"I don't put up with bullies
and when you kick back,

00:03:17.834 --> 00:03:19.667
it hurts them more
if you're wearing heels."

00:03:19.667 --> 00:03:23.901
Whoa, what job does
she think this is?

00:03:23.901 --> 00:03:27.634
Does she want to be president
or teach Krav Maga?

00:03:27.634 --> 00:03:29.033
"When I fight
for the middle class,

00:03:29.033 --> 00:03:32.868
I'll hold my keys so they stick
out between my fingers."

00:03:32.868 --> 00:03:34.334
She does make
an interesting point, though.

00:03:34.334 --> 00:03:37.067
If she wins, she'd be the
first president to wear heels

00:03:37.067 --> 00:03:39.067
since the last president.

00:03:44.300 --> 00:03:47.701
A lawyer for President Trump
said recently that Trump

00:03:47.701 --> 00:03:50.133
was using a manila folder marked
"Classified"

00:03:50.133 --> 00:03:53.000
to block a small light
on a landline phone

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:54.901
next to his bed --
even weirder,

00:03:54.901 --> 00:03:57.934
all the ones that he taped up
to use in place of curtains.

00:04:00.167 --> 00:04:02.868
Buckingham Palace yesterday
announced that Queen Camilla

00:04:02.868 --> 00:04:04.434
tested positive
for coronavirus.

00:04:04.434 --> 00:04:06.968
Luckily, as a royal,
she was already planning

00:04:06.968 --> 00:04:09.200
on doing nothing
for the next few weeks.

00:04:11.934 --> 00:04:13.968
The maker of the robot
vacuum cleaner Roomba

00:04:13.968 --> 00:04:16.300
announced yesterday
that the company would lay off

00:04:16.300 --> 00:04:17.968
roughly 7% of its workforce.

00:04:17.968 --> 00:04:19.400
And since it was Roomba,

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:22.167
it took everyone 45 minutes
to find the door.

00:04:24.367 --> 00:04:26.934
Finally, according to
a new analysis by Yelp,

00:04:26.934 --> 00:04:28.734
the most romantic restaurant
in Wisconsin

00:04:28.734 --> 00:04:30.167
is Grandpa's Pizza.

00:04:30.167 --> 00:04:31.801
That story again,

00:04:31.801 --> 00:04:36.701
the only restaurant in Wisconsin
is Grandpa's Pizza.

00:04:36.701 --> 00:04:40.067
The Pentagon this week described
the unidentified object

00:04:40.067 --> 00:04:42.234
shot down over Canada
on Saturday

00:04:42.234 --> 00:04:45.033
as a, quote,
small metallic balloon.

00:04:45.033 --> 00:04:48.033
So it was either a dire
national security threat

00:04:48.033 --> 00:04:52.334
or a wasted 25¢
at a county fair.

00:04:52.334 --> 00:04:56.033
"Hold on to that, Tyler!
Oh, son of a gun."

00:04:56.033 --> 00:04:57.667
President Biden
is reportedly considering

00:04:57.667 --> 00:04:59.534
making a national
televised address

00:04:59.534 --> 00:05:02.133
to discuss the recent
unidentified flying objects.

00:05:02.133 --> 00:05:03.767
Oh, yeah, definitely,
please do that.

00:05:03.767 --> 00:05:05.968
Interrupt an episode of
"The Voice"

00:05:05.968 --> 00:05:08.567
and walk 30 yards down
that long red carpet

00:05:08.567 --> 00:05:11.267
to a podium like Obama did
when we got bin Laden,

00:05:11.267 --> 00:05:14.200
and tell the American people
you popped some balloons.

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:16.200
"Now, my fellow Americans,

00:05:16.200 --> 00:05:18.767
it's true what they say:
once you pop,

00:05:18.767 --> 00:05:21.868
you just can't stop."

00:05:21.868 --> 00:05:24.334
President Biden announced
yesterday that Air India

00:05:24.334 --> 00:05:26.701
will purchase more than
200 planes from Boeing,

00:05:26.701 --> 00:05:29.834
while Frontier is buying
200 planes from Goodwill.

00:05:32.701 --> 00:05:35.000
During the White House
press briefing yesterday,

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:36.701
a reporter from Newsmax asked

00:05:36.701 --> 00:05:39.167
Press Secretary
Karine Jean-Pierre, quote,

00:05:39.167 --> 00:05:41.300
Is President Biden woke?

00:05:41.300 --> 00:05:44.400
And she rolled her eyes so hard
they didn't come back.

00:05:49.968 --> 00:05:53.868
More haunting than I think
we planned.

00:05:53.868 --> 00:05:56.734
President Biden said yesterday
that the back and forth

00:05:56.734 --> 00:05:59.267
with Republicans in his
State of the Union address

00:05:59.267 --> 00:06:02.400
made him feel like he was,
quote, back on the playground.

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:05.133
"So jealous,"
said Matt Gaetz.

00:06:10.934 --> 00:06:13.467
Senator Ted Cruz
told reporters yesterday

00:06:13.467 --> 00:06:15.634
that he plans to run
for a third term.

00:06:15.634 --> 00:06:19.033
Cruz said he discussed it with
his family and they insisted.

00:06:22.033 --> 00:06:26.133
The company Volt Candy has
issued a recall for its

00:06:26.133 --> 00:06:29.634
PrimeZen Black 6000
male enhancement pill

00:06:29.634 --> 00:06:31.834
because it contains
two unapproved drugs.

00:06:31.834 --> 00:06:33.501
Yeah, something tells me
that people who bought

00:06:33.501 --> 00:06:35.701
that don't keep their receipts.

00:06:35.701 --> 00:06:38.701
I think they're going
to have to eat the $9.95.

00:06:38.701 --> 00:06:43.133
And it doesn't matter
how I know how much it costs.

00:06:46.100 --> 00:06:47.701
Two for $18.

00:06:50.734 --> 00:06:53.868
The fast food chain Chipotle has
announced plans to open

00:06:53.868 --> 00:06:56.234
a new brand called
Farmesa Fresh Eatery,

00:06:56.234 --> 00:06:58.667
which will focus on
farm-to-table cuisine,

00:06:58.667 --> 00:07:01.400
as opposed to their usual
table-to-restroom.

00:07:06.234 --> 00:07:07.968
A Philadelphia Eagles fan

00:07:07.968 --> 00:07:09.434
was arrested
on Sunday in Florida

00:07:09.434 --> 00:07:11.734
after he allegedly
broke into a fire house,

00:07:11.734 --> 00:07:14.234
peed on the carpet,
stole a hat

00:07:14.234 --> 00:07:16.234
and threw a knife
at a firefighter --

00:07:16.234 --> 00:07:19.868
and then he found out
the Eagles lost!

00:07:23.968 --> 00:07:25.734
And finally, a Florida
city councilman

00:07:25.734 --> 00:07:28.067
was arrested over the weekend
after authorities allegedly

00:07:28.067 --> 00:07:30.601
found ten grams of cocaine
in his shoe.

00:07:30.601 --> 00:07:32.100
Police first became suspicious

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:35.701
when someone in Florida
was wearing shoes.

00:07:35.701 --> 00:07:39.367
President Biden had his annual
physical today at Walter Reed.

00:07:39.367 --> 00:07:41.300
Doctors say
he's fit as a fiddle,

00:07:41.300 --> 00:07:46.567
specifically, this 300 year old
Stradivarius.

00:07:46.567 --> 00:07:49.334
That's right, President Biden
today had his annual physical.

00:07:49.334 --> 00:07:52.234
And I think Fox News
messed with his eye chart.

00:07:54.534 --> 00:07:59.234
Wouldn't count -- wouldn't be
legally binding.

00:07:59.234 --> 00:08:01.834
According to a new report
top Democrats privately think

00:08:01.834 --> 00:08:04.067
that President Biden is too old
for reelection,

00:08:04.067 --> 00:08:06.334
but worry that his decision
not to run

00:08:06.334 --> 00:08:08.601
would cause chaos
in the Democratic Party.

00:08:08.601 --> 00:08:10.467
You guys didn't see this coming?

00:08:10.467 --> 00:08:13.968
We elected a half-finished game
of Jenga

00:08:13.968 --> 00:08:19.868
and now you all say, "Oh, no,
everybody move your drinks!"

00:08:19.868 --> 00:08:21.767
President Biden
spoke publicly today

00:08:21.767 --> 00:08:24.334
about the aerial objects
shot down by the military;

00:08:24.334 --> 00:08:26.801
said Biden, "The American people
deserve to know

00:08:26.801 --> 00:08:31.701
how much fun
this week has been for me."

00:08:31.701 --> 00:08:34.534
Acting FAA administrator
Billy Nolan testified before

00:08:34.534 --> 00:08:37.467
the Senate yesterday on the
agency's handling of recent

00:08:37.467 --> 00:08:39.601
near collisions at airports

00:08:39.601 --> 00:08:42.200
and assured Americans
that flying is safe.

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:44.234
I don't know, at this point,
the best you can say

00:08:44.234 --> 00:08:48.667
is that it's safer
than traveling via balloon.

00:08:48.667 --> 00:08:53.100
I would not want to travel
via balloon right now.

00:08:53.100 --> 00:08:54.968
The FAA this week
announced plans

00:08:54.968 --> 00:08:57.067
for an airline
industry safety summit

00:08:57.067 --> 00:08:59.067
after a recent series
of near accidents.

00:08:59.067 --> 00:09:01.133
But don't worry,
you only need to attend

00:09:01.133 --> 00:09:02.834
if you're in the exit row.

00:09:09.934 --> 00:09:11.300
Oh, boy. Oh, boy.

00:09:13.634 --> 00:09:16.534
[ Laughs ]

00:09:16.534 --> 00:09:18.133
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:09:22.334 --> 00:09:24.434
A lawyer for Florida
Congressman Matt Gaetz

00:09:24.434 --> 00:09:26.667
said yesterday that the
Justice Department informed

00:09:26.667 --> 00:09:29.000
Gaetz that they will not
move forward with charges

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:31.601
relating to his sex
trafficking investigation

00:09:31.601 --> 00:09:33.634
and that Gaetz
has learned his lesson.

00:09:33.634 --> 00:09:35.667
"Venmo set to private"!

00:09:37.934 --> 00:09:40.033
"The New York Times" published
an op ed yesterday

00:09:40.033 --> 00:09:42.367
about Republican presidential
hopeful Nikki Haley,

00:09:42.367 --> 00:09:44.801
titled "Nikki Haley Will Not Be
the Next President."

00:09:44.801 --> 00:09:46.834
Yeah, I'm not falling
for that one anymore.

00:09:46.834 --> 00:09:50.234
The last guy they said would
never be the next president,

00:09:50.234 --> 00:09:52.033
turns out he was
the next president.

00:09:52.033 --> 00:09:55.901
Also, still might be
the next president.

00:09:55.901 --> 00:09:58.567
Elon Musk said yesterday
that artificial intelligence

00:09:58.567 --> 00:10:00.634
has great promise
and capability,

00:10:00.634 --> 00:10:03.033
but added that it comes
with, quote, great danger.

00:10:03.033 --> 00:10:05.801
So either he's one of the
great minds of our generation

00:10:05.801 --> 00:10:10.133
or we finally saw
"The Terminator."

00:10:10.133 --> 00:10:11.968
According to a new study,
Cleveland and Detroit

00:10:11.968 --> 00:10:14.534
are the least expensive
U.S. cities for single people,

00:10:14.534 --> 00:10:16.734
in the same way that the
cheapest car you can buy

00:10:16.734 --> 00:10:18.234
is just to walk.

00:10:24.634 --> 00:10:28.501
And finally, today was national
Do a Grouch a Favor Day.

00:10:28.501 --> 00:10:32.400
Okay, off the top of my head,
let him crash with you?!

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:35.434
Hey, it's our friend who lives
in the garbage and eats trash!

00:10:35.434 --> 00:10:37.434
Well, see you later.

00:10:37.434 --> 00:10:39.400
That was a monologue,
everybody.

00:10:39.400 --> 00:10:44.133
♪♪

